{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（25日）是台灣光復81周年，也是大陸設立台灣光復紀念日一周年。</p><p>央視新聞發布「吉林一號」衛星影像俯瞰台灣，標記「這是中國台灣省」，影片從台灣島空拍畫面延伸至台北中正紀念堂、故宮、台北大巨蛋、台北港等地標。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T02:40:52.413642+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:38:04.119760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T02:38:04.119760+00:00","content_hash":"b9dc9a00c4ecb5fa33f665e82f0d8908680189d3f31b8ec8f15cca99bd960ce3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}